    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-impact-p03-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "不 / 早: 早也不X晚也不X criticizes timing",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "早也不X晚也不X criticizes an action's inconvenient timing. The complaint concerns this moment, not a literal ban on early and late actions.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "早也不来，晚也不来，就在现在来。",
                "pinyin": "zǎo yě bù lái ， wǎn yě bù lái ， jiù zài xiànzài lái 。",
                "meaning": "You had to come at this inconvenient moment of all times.",
                "audio": "a518811182044af6e5477ca32c6c44a1db00a4d75c6dd9ddca92746cdcae3865"
              },
              {
                "text": "早也不说，晚也不说，现在才说。",
                "pinyin": "zǎo yě bù shuō ， wǎn yě bù shuō ， xiànzài cái shuō 。",
                "meaning": "You wait until this moment of all times to say it.",
                "audio": "eb1ce49b2725e8f621aae930791287eeb68c1a0912c1955ea1450a08686216e0"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
